<title>ETHIOPIA: Ethiopian birr weakens against the dollar.</title>
<headline>Ethiopian birr weakens against the dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ADDIS ABABA 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ethiopian birr was marginally weaker against the dollar on Monday, the central National Bank of Ethiopia (NBE) said.</p>
<p>It posted the birr at a mean rate of 6.4510 against the dollar compared to 6.436 last week.</p>
<p>Against the pound, the NBE posted the birr at a mean rate of 10.8679 from 10.8942 last week, at 0.055973 from 0.055449 on the yen, and at 4.0891 from 4.0834 against the mark.</p>
</text>
